Standarization intution
---> this is also known as z score normalization
---> when you do standarization the graph of data remain the same , it does not change at all

when  to  use Standarization:
1: K Means 
2: K nearest neighbours
3: principal components analysis(PCA)
4: Artificial Neural Network 
5: Gradient Descent


